{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Colour Invert 是一款 Safari 擴充功能，可一鍵反轉網頁配色，將明亮頁面轉為深色，或切換成不同視覺效果。適合夜間閱讀、需要高對比瀏覽，或想調整網站顯示風格的用戶。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-113.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>快速反轉網頁配色</h2>\n<p>Colour Invert 可在 Safari 內快速反轉網頁顏色，毋須離開瀏覽器；用戶可隨時開啟或關閉效果，亦可透過全域控制切換，讓網站顯示風格更貼合閱讀習慣。工具以簡潔介面提供所需操作，沒有複雜設定，亦毋須建立帳戶，專注於改變網頁外觀。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-106-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-107-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-108-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-109-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-110-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-111-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Colour Invert</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/colour-invert/id6811389278?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.679183+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":291,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T06:36:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T10:15:42.700307+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:43.813445+00:00","content_hash":"b6a13cf9f2c2340856b1e0f493ab34af41a5928b44e20af14bd60e8ecba64c9b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.679183+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}